<title>USA: U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. rice major sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:	1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p> Turkey	   36,400-A		 Nil</p>
<p> Jamaica	  15,800</p>
<p> Mexico	   12,700-B</p>
<p>A- includes 12,500 tonnes of rough rice.</p>
<p>B- includes 11,500 tonnes of rough rice.</p>
<p>Net sales of 85,400 tonnes were three times the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 49,900 were 32 percent above the previous week.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Turkey, Mexico, Belgium and Holland.</p>
</text>
